        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is C4 whey protein good?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It is a good flavored whey at a fair price in the big tub. Each scoop gives 25 g of protein in about 130 to 140 calories with 0 g of added sugar, per the label. The Hershey's chocolate gets strong buyer feedback. Its weaknesses are the concentrate-first blend, artificial sweeteners and no sport certification we could find."
          }
        },
